/README.md
Purpose: Human guide to the MUD Builder — deployment/write-gating model, two reload tiers (hot upsert vs copyover), a plain-language "Getting started" walkthrough (no jargon: launch the 4 pieces, sign up on the account website, create an API key, paste it into the builder's Access tab, w/ a mermaid sequenceDiagram of the whole account->key->save round trip, cross-linked with the technical Phase 9 section below it), per-tab authoring docs (header/socials/world Phase 6, skills.dat data overlay Phase 7, groups.dat overlay with cycle/prefix rules Phase 8, mob scripts Phase 2), Phase 9 access model (first-run master key, UI-managed API keys, audit log), Phase 10 .are import (quarantine validation, overwrite semantics) + audit viewer, Phase 11 multi-builder safety (hash-conditional saves w/ conflict panel, advisory presence, resolved cross-area reference links), Phase 12 world map (Map tab: BFS-grid area maps w/ portal stubs, world graph from resolved exits, read-only) + overlay baseHash, Phase 12b mapping fidelity (10-direction rose, room-script warp teleports, exit classification legend, grouped resets, limit-pressure flags, INVALID refs, auth/ dir + pnpm generate-master-key rotation), Phase 13 reset simulator (db.c-faithful boot-state spawn preview: Simulate pane w/ gear trees + warnings, room-editor link, map spawn-badge overlay, read-only), Phase 14a/14b spell codegen + map exit editor, Phase 15 engine rebuild/redeploy (Engine tab, mermaid pipeline diagram, live-verified evidence), guarantees and accepted drift, current scope.

